crews-omp includes the deterministic Crews Python core from mdalexandre/crews (MIT).
Original license is retained in LICENSE.

Routing design was informed by sdananjay/omp-task-router v0.1.2,
commit 59ddb828bf1e9271618462ed9b68cda600df207d (MIT).
